      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹1.71 (down from ₹4.10 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹7.46b (up 8.0% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹203.0m (down 58% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 2.7% (down from 7.0% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 1% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 9% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
